<p>This is <em>very<sup class="footnote-ref"><a href="#fn-v" id="fnref-v" data-footnote-ref>1</a></sup></em> important and <strong>bold</strong><sup class="footnote-ref"><a href="#fn-v" id="fnref-v-2" data-footnote-ref>1</a></sup>.</p>
